          <hcontainer name="part" eId="schedule-1__part-2">
            <num>2</num>
            <heading>Transitional</heading>
            <hcontainer name="clause" eId="schedule-1__part-2__clause-22">
              <num>22</num>
              <heading>Transitional—annual registration charge and entry to market charges</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Despite the repeal of sections 23 and 23A of the <i>Education Services for Overseas Students Act 2000</i> by this Schedule, those sections continue to apply in relation to a charge that became due for payment before the commencement of this item, as if that repeal had not happened.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="clause" eId="schedule-1__part-2__clause-23">
              <num>23</num>
              <heading>Transitional—automatic suspension</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Despite the amendment of <ref href="#sec-90">section 90</ref> of the <i>Education Services for Overseas Students Act 2000</i> made by this Schedule, that section continues to apply in relation to a notice given under <ref href="#sec-23">section 23</ref> or 23A of that Act before the commencement of this item, as if that amendment had not been made.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="clause" eId="schedule-1__part-2__clause-24">
              <num>24</num>
              <heading>Transitional—late payment penalties</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Despite the amendment of <ref href="#sec-172">section 172</ref> of the <i>Education Services for Overseas Students Act 2000</i> made by this Schedule, that section continues to apply in relation to a charge that became due for payment before the commencement of this item, as if that amendment had not been made.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="clause" eId="schedule-1__part-2__clause-25">
              <num>25</num>
              <heading>Transitional—debts due to the Commonwealth</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Despite the amendment of <ref href="#sec-173">section 173</ref> of the <i>Education Services for Overseas Students Act 2000</i> made by this Schedule, that section continues to apply in relation to a charge that became due for payment before the commencement of this item, as if that amendment had not been made.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
          </hcontainer>
